# PC card team-table (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.3, TMODE-16..18): arm mt (the screen's table) on the picked teams, fresh seeds, against master (the aa build). Template: ttprep writes work/team-table-conf.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
12
--seed-base
4300
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-table-confirm.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@mt.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@mt
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-table-@V@-conf
